### 実施概要

1. **`clis-rulebook`（[[clis-rulebook.md](file:///workspaces/specdojo-workspace/worktrees/prj-0001-PJR-1K77/docs/ja/specdojo/rulebooks/clis-rulebook.md)]）の改訂**:
